stment.</li>\n<li>Proficient with no armor unless trained for war. (See <em>FAQ</em>s and <em>Handle Animal Skill</em>.)</li>\n<li>Animals breathe, eat, and sleep.</li>\n</ul>","instructions":""},"tags":[],"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"classAssociations":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"animal","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"racial","level":5,"hd":8,"hp":22,"bab":"med","skillsPerLevel":2,"savingThrows":{"fort":{"value":"high"},"ref":{"value":"high"},"will":{"value":"low"}},"fc":{"hp":{"value":0},"skill":{"value":0},"alt":{"value":0,"notes":""}},"wealth":"","alignment":"","classSkills":{"acr":true,"clm":true,"fly":true,"per":true,"ste":true,"swm":true}},"type":"class","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":112500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.racial-hd.Item.WJqmmfXscPVpcISH"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"CqEtV5JbcKqctvI7","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124904274,"modifiedTime":1795124907110,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/endurance.png","name":"Endurance","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>Harsh conditions or long exertions do not easily tire you.</i><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You gain a +4 bonus on the following checks and saves: Swim checks made to resist nonlethal damage from exhaustion; Constitution checks made to continue running; Constitution checks made to avoid nonlethal damage from a forced march; Constitution checks made to hold your breath; Constitution checks made to avoid nonlethal damage from starvation or thirst; Fortitude saves made to avoid nonlethal damage from hot or cold environments; and Fortitude saves made to resist damage from suffocation.</p><p>You may sleep in light or medium armor without becoming fatigued.</p><p><strong>Normal</strong>: A character without this feat who sleeps in medium or heavier armor is fatigued the next day.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"115, 122"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.ehqx8txNRGMaNOPt"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"Hx8hyK1sKts9t8Ni","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124904315,"modifiedTime":1795124907110,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/improved-bull-rush.jpg","name":"Improved Bull Rush","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>You are skilled at pushing your foes around.</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Str 13, @UUID[Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.FUW5mIXHNBBIQ1Sq]{Power Attack}, base attack bonus +1.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You do not provoke an attack of opportunity when performing a bull rush combat maneuver. In addition, you receive a +2 bonus on checks made to bull rush a foe. You also receive a +2 bonus to your Combat Maneuver Defense whenever an opponent tries to bull rush you.</p><p><strong>Normal</strong>: You provoke an attack of opportunity when performing a bull rush combat maneuver.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Combat","Offensive","Combat Maneuver","Combat Trick"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[{"target":"cmb","text":"+[[2]] and no AoO on Bull Rush."},{"target":"cmd","text":"+[[2]] vs Bull Rush"}],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"126"},{"id":"PZO1131","pages":"122"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":312500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.dn2KgHFQRbuoNRx0"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"vrTtXr9ybDB97mT8","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124904355,"modifiedTime":1795124907110,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/power-attack.jpg","name":"Power Attack","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>You can make exceptionally deadly melee attacks by sacrificing accuracy for strength.</i><p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Str 13, base attack bonus +1.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You can choose to take a -1 penalty on all melee attack rolls and combat maneuver checks to gain a +2 bonus on all melee damage rolls. This bonus to damage is increased by half (+50%) if you are making an attack with a two-handed weapon, a one handed weapon using two hands, or a primary natural weapon that adds 1-1/2 times your Strength modifier on damage rolls. This bonus to damage is halved (-50%) if you are making an attack with an off-hand weapon or secondary natural weapon. When your base attack bonus reaches +4, and every 4 points thereafter, the penalty increases by -1 and the bonus to damage increases by +2. You must choose to use this feat before making an attack roll, and its effects last until your next turn. The bonus damage does not apply to touch attacks or effects that do not deal hit point damage.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Combat","Offensive"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"116, 131"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":512500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.FUW5mIXHNBBIQ1Sq"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"name":"stampede (see aurochs)","type":"attack","system":{"description":{"value":"sbc | Placeholder for Special Attacks, which in most statblocks are listed under 'Special Attacks' in the statistics block, but are described in the 'Special Abilities' block. Remove duplicates as needed!","instructions":""},"tags":[],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"scriptCalls":[],"masterwork":false,"enh":null,"proficient":false,"held":"1h","ammo":{"type":"","capacity":null,"misfire":null,"explode":null},"subType":"misc","baseTypes":[],"broken":false,"weaponGroups":[],"showInQuickbar":true,"size":"med"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/skills/yellow_36.jpg","_id":"hgmFvoJfMiP0mSEq","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124904770,"modifiedTime":1795124907110,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"MMjGGSYJFOttCCrk","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795124904960,"modifiedTime":1795124907110,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/foot-black-grey.webp","name":"Trample (2d6+12, DC 20)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a full-round action, a creature with the trample ability can attempt to overrun any creature that is at least one size category smaller than itself. This works just like the overrun combat maneuver, but the trampling creature does not need to attempt a check; it merely has to move over opponents in its path. Targets of a trample take an amount of damage equal to the trampling creature’s slam damage + 1-1/2 times its Strength modifier. Targets of a trample can make an attack of opportunity, but at a –4 penalty. If a target forgoes an attack of opportunity, it can attempt a Reflex save to avoid the trampling creature and take half damage. The save DC against a creature’s trample attack is 10 + 1/2 the creature’s HD + the creature’s Strength modifier (the exact DC is given in the creature’s descriptive text). A trampling creature can only deal its trampling damage to each target once per round, no matter how many times its movement takes it over a target creature. A trampling creature can move up to twice its land speed as part of the trample.</p><p><em>Format</em>: trample (2d6+9, DC 20)</p><p><em>Location</em>: Special Attacks.</p><p><em>Usage:</em> Replace damage and DC</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Universal Monster Rules"],"actions":[{"_id":"zshy03oqaie1ul8l","actionType":"save","activation":{"type":"nonaction","unchained":{"type":"nonaction","cost":1},"cost":1},"attackName":"Trample","damage":{"parts":[{"formula":"2d6+12"}]},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/foot-black-grey.webp","name":"Use","save":{"dc":"20","type":"ref","harmless":false},"tag":"trampleEx","uses":{},"powerAttack":{"damageBonus":2,"critMultiplier":1},"notes":{"effect":[""]}}],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"misc","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"ex","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":612500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-universal-m